  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote an integrated, sustainable and low-emission transport system in Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Active</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve the mobility of the population while reducing the consumption of fossil fuels, responsible for greenhouse gas emissions in the transport sector in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire, and minimizing the emissions of suspended particulate matters which are responsible of the death of thousands of people every year. The approach proposed is to promote low carbon modes of transport in order to catalyze a paradigm shift; from fossil fuel vehicles to electric vehicles and non-motorized transport systems. The project will be carried out by a team of national and international.</narrative>
  </description>
